# {{projectName}}

A [FastMCP](https://gofastmcp.com) server scaffolded with
[`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude). It exposes MCP **tools**,
**resources** (incl. templates), and **prompts** to any MCP client.

## Quick start

```bash
# 1. Install the launcher (one-time, global)
npm install -g @cubocicloide/dude-launcher

# 2. Provision the pinned toolchain
pnpm install

# 3. Build + start the server (streamable HTTP on http://localhost:8000/mcp/)
dude up --build
```

## Try it

```bash
# MCP Inspector (protocol debugger, no LLM):
docker compose --profile dev up --build
# → http://localhost:6274 → "Streamable HTTP" → http://fastmcp:8000/mcp/
```

To chat with the server through an LLM (Claude Desktop / Claude Code), see
`docs/docs/connect.md`.

## Common commands

| Command | What it does |
|---------|--------------|
| `dude up` / `dude down` | Start / stop the server |
| `dude logs` / `dude shell` | Follow logs / open a shell in the container |
| `dude lint` | Structural MCP checks (see `.claude/rules/MCP/`) |
| `dude format` | `ruff` format + import sort |
| `dude review` | lint + `ruff check` + `mypy --strict` |
| `dude test` | pytest (unit + in-memory MCP integration) |
| `dude security scan` | Bandit + Semgrep + Trivy |
| `dude docs` | Serve the docs at http://localhost:8001 |

Run `dude help` for the live, full catalog.

